// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
//  NEON‑NIRI v2  ·  Base Configuration
//  This file contains the shared compositor configuration. Per-context
//  overrides live in dev-mode.kdl and game-mode.kdl.
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

// ──────────────────────────────── Cursor ────────────────────────────────
cursor {
    xcursor-theme "Bibata-Modern-Ice"
    size 24
}

// ──────────────────────────────── Input ─────────────────────────────────
input {
    keyboard {
        xkb {
            layout "br"
            options "caps:escape"
        }
        repeat-delay 220
        repeat-rate 70
    }

    mouse {
        accel-profile "flat"
        accel-speed 0.0
    }

    touchpad {
        tap
        natural-scroll
        accel-profile "flat"
        accel-speed 0.0
    }
}

// ──────────────────────────────── Outputs ───────────────────────────────
output "DP-1" {
    mode "2560x1440@165"
    scale 1.0
    position x=0 y=0
    focus-at-startup
    vrr
}

output "HDMI-A-1" {
    mode "1920x1080@60"
    scale 1.0
    position x=2560 y=0
}

// ──────────────────────────────── Layout ────────────────────────────────
layout {
    gaps 6
    center-focused-column "always"
    default-column-width { proportion 0.55; }
    focus-ring {
        width 2
        active-color "#bd93f9"
        inactive-color "#44475a"
    }
    border {
        width 1
        active-color "#ff79c6"
        inactive-color "#44475a"
    }
    struts {
        top 36   // leave room for Quickshell bar
    }
}

// ─────────────────────────────── Animations ─────────────────────────────
animations {
    workspace-switch {
        spring damping-ratio=1.0 stiffness=900 epsilon=0.0001
    }
    window-movement {
        spring damping-ratio=1.0 stiffness=700 epsilon=0.0001
    }
    window-open {
        duration-ms 150
    }
    window-close {
        duration-ms 120
    }
}

// ─────────────────────────────── Rules ─────────────────────────────────
window-rule {
    // Rounded corners for most windows
    geometry-corner-radius 8
    clip-to-geometry true
}

window-rule {
    match app-id="kitty"
    default-column-width { proportion 0.5; }
}

window-rule {
    match app-id="firefox|brave-browser|chromium"
    default-column-width { proportion 0.75; }
}

window-rule {
    match app-id="Code|code-oss|com.visualstudio.code"
    open-on-workspace 3
    default-column-width { proportion 0.8; }
}

window-rule {
    match app-id="discord|Slack|telegram-desktop"
    open-on-workspace 4
    default-column-width { proportion 0.35; }
}

window-rule {
    match app-id="spotify"
    open-on-workspace 5
}

window-rule {
    match app-id="steam|lutris"
    open-on-workspace 8
}

window-rule {
    match app-id="com.obsproject.Studio"
    open-on-workspace 9
}

// ─────────────────────────────── Keybinds ───────────────────────────────
binds {
    // Applications
    Mod+Return { spawn "kitty"; }
    Mod+D { spawn "rofi" "-show" "drun"; }
    Mod+Shift+D { spawn "rofi" "-show" "run"; }
    Mod+E { spawn "dolphin"; }
    Mod+Shift+Escape { spawn "hyprlock"; }

    // Context switching (requires ~/.local/bin/context-switch)
    Mod+F11 { spawn "context-switch" "dev"; }
    Mod+F12 { spawn "context-switch" "game"; }
    Mod+Shift+F12 { spawn "context-switch" "default"; }

    // Workspaces
    Mod+1 { focus-workspace 1; }
    Mod+2 { focus-workspace 2; }
    Mod+3 { focus-workspace 3; }
    Mod+4 { focus-workspace 4; }
    Mod+5 { focus-workspace 5; }
    Mod+6 { focus-workspace 6; }
    Mod+7 { focus-workspace 7; }
    Mod+8 { focus-workspace 8; }
    Mod+9 { focus-workspace 9; }

    Mod+Ctrl+1 { move-column-to-workspace 1; }
    Mod+Ctrl+2 { move-column-to-workspace 2; }
    Mod+Ctrl+3 { move-column-to-workspace 3; }
    Mod+Ctrl+4 { move-column-to-workspace 4; }
    Mod+Ctrl+5 { move-column-to-workspace 5; }
    Mod+Ctrl+6 { move-column-to-workspace 6; }
    Mod+Ctrl+7 { move-column-to-workspace 7; }
    Mod+Ctrl+8 { move-column-to-workspace 8; }
    Mod+Ctrl+9 { move-column-to-workspace 9; }

    // Navigation
    Mod+H { focus-column-left; }
    Mod+L { focus-column-right; }
    Mod+J { focus-window-down; }
    Mod+K { focus-window-up; }
    Mod+Shift+H { move-column-left; }
    Mod+Shift+L { move-column-right; }
    Mod+Shift+J { move-window-down; }
    Mod+Shift+K { move-window-up; }

    // Layout controls
    Mod+Space { toggle-window-floating; }
    Mod+F { maximize-column; }
    Mod+Shift+F { fullscreen-window; }
    Mod+Minus { set-column-width "-10%"; }
    Mod+Equal { set-column-width "+10%"; }

    // Screenshots
    Print { spawn "~/.local/bin/screenshot" "full"; }
    Shift+Print { spawn "~/.local/bin/screenshot" "region"; }

    // Audio / Brightness (fallback using wpctl/brightnessctl)
    XF86AudioRaiseVolume { spawn "wpctl" "set-volume" "@DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@" "0.05+"; }
    XF86AudioLowerVolume { spawn "wpctl" "set-volume" "@DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@" "0.05-"; }
    XF86AudioMute { spawn "wpctl" "set-mute" "@DEFAULT_AUDIO_SINK@" "toggle"; }
    XF86AudioMicMute { spawn "wpctl" "set-mute" "@DEFAULT_AUDIO_SOURCE@" "toggle"; }
    XF86MonBrightnessUp { spawn "brightnessctl" "set" "+5%"; }
    XF86MonBrightnessDown { spawn "brightnessctl" "set" "5%-"; }

    // Gaming helpers
    Mod+G { spawn "~/.local/bin/game-launcher"; }
    Mod+M { spawn "wpctl" "set-mute" "@DEFAULT_AUDIO_SOURCE@" "toggle"; }
}

// ──────────────────────────── Environment ───────────────────────────────
environment {
    "XDG_SESSION_TYPE" "wayland"
    "QT_QPA_PLATFORM" "wayland"
    "GDK_BACKEND" "wayland"
    "SDL_VIDEODRIVER" "wayland"
    "MOZ_ENABLE_WAYLAND" "1"
    "ELECTRON_OZONE_PLATFORM_HINT" "wayland"
    "MANGOHUD" "1"
}

// ─────────────────────────────── Startup ────────────────────────────────
spawn-at-startup "systemctl" "--user" "start" "quickshell.service"
spawn-at-startup "systemctl" "--user" "start" "dunst.service"
spawn-at-startup "~/.local/bin/context-switch" "default"
spawn-at-startup "swaybg" "-i" "~/.local/share/wallpapers/neon.png"
